## 3. PROJECT STRUCTURE
 
```
miur/                          ← Next.js project root (open THIS in Cursor)
  app/
    layout.tsx                 ← Root layout: Navbar, Footer, CookieBanner, AccessibilityWidget
    page.tsx                   ← Homepage: Hero → TrustBar → CategoryGrid → BestSellers → Wyprzedaz → Blog → Philosophy
    globals.css                ← Tailwind 4 config + CSS vars + accessibility classes
    (routes)/                  ← App Router pages
  components/
    layout/                    ← Full-section components (Hero, Navbar, Footer, etc.)
    ui/                        ← shadcn primitives + small shared components
    AccessibilityWidget.tsx    ← Accessibility toolbar (client component)
    theme-provider.tsx
  lib/
    utils.ts                   ← cn() utility
    catalog/                   ← Product types, adapters, bestsellers, wyprzedaz data
    blog/                      ← Blog post types and data fetching
  hooks/                       ← Custom React hooks (create if needed)
  types/                       ← Shared TypeScript types (create if needed)
  public/
    fonts/wildloops-bold_w.ttf ← Logo font
    hero.mp4 / hero.webm       ← Hero background video
    hero-poster.jpg
EU_PL_Compliance/              ← Legal docs for AI reference (see §11)
```
 
