## 8. ACCESSIBILITY — MANDATORY (EAA active since 28.06.2025)
 
```tsx
// ✅ Skip link — must be first element in layout.tsx
<a
  href="#main-content"
  className="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-9999 focus:bg-white focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:rounded focus:text-zinc-900 focus:font-bold focus:text-sm"
>
  Przejdź do treści głównej
</a>
 
// ✅ Focus visible on all interactive elements
className="focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-zinc-900 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-none"
 
// ✅ Semantic HTML — use landmarks
<nav>, <main id="main-content">, <header>, <footer>, <section>, <article>
 
// ✅ ARIA for interactive components
// Dialog/modal: role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dialog-title"
// CookieBanner: role="dialog" aria-labelledby="cookie-title"
 
// ✅ Form errors
<input aria-describedby="field-error" aria-invalid={!!error} />
{error && <p id="field-error" role="alert" className="text-xs text-red-600">{error}</p>}
 
// ✅ Icon buttons need accessible label
<button aria-label="Dodaj do koszyka">
  <ShoppingBag className="w-5 h-5" />
</button>
 
// ✅ Reduce motion
const shouldReduceMotion = useReducedMotion();
const animationProps = shouldReduceMotion ? {} : { initial: ..., animate: ... };
 
// ❌ Avoid — zinc-400 text on white background fails WCAG AA (ratio ~2.9:1)
// ✅ Minimum: zinc-500 (#71717a) on white = ~4.6:1 ✅
```
 
Full details: `EU_PL_Compliance/04_Accessibility_WCAG.md`
 
