## 9. UI TEXT & LANGUAGE
 
```
User-facing text:    Polish (pl)
Code comments:       English
Commit messages:     English
html lang attribute: "pl" (already in layout.tsx ✅)
 
Polish e-commerce vocabulary:
  Koszyk          → cart
  Zamówienie      → order
  Dostawa         → delivery/shipping
  Zwrot           → return/refund
  Regulamin       → terms of service
  Polityka prywatności → privacy policy
  Dodaj do koszyka → add to cart
  Zamawiam i płacę → place order (LEGALLY REQUIRED — not "Dalej"/"Kontynuuj")
  Najniższa cena z 30 dni → lowest price in 30 days (Omnibus — REQUIRED)
```
 
---
 
## 10. WHAT NOT TO DO
 
```
❌ Pages Router          — use App Router only
❌ tailwind.config.js    — Tailwind 4 uses CSS config only
❌ @tailwind directives  — use @import "tailwindcss"
❌ CSS modules           — Tailwind only
❌ Inline styles         — Tailwind only (exception: framer-motion style prop)
❌ any TypeScript type   — always type properly
❌ Default exports for components — named exports only (except app/**/page.tsx)
❌ ../../../ import paths — always @/ alias
❌ Dark mode             — not in v1 scope
❌ New npm packages without asking Bogdan — check first
❌ useEffect for data fetching in server components — fetch directly
❌ <img> tag             — always next/image
❌ Empty alt="" on meaningful images — always descriptive
❌ Buttons without accessible labels — add aria-label
❌ "Dalej" or "Kontynuuj" on checkout button — must be "Zamawiam i płacę"
❌ Displaying strikethrough price without lowestPrice30Days — Omnibus law violation
❌ Marketing cookies before consent — GDPR violation
```
 
---
 
