## 13. WHEN CREATING NEW COMPONENTS
 
Checklist before writing:
1. Does a shadcn component already handle this? → `npx shadcn@latest add`
2. Is this a layout component or a UI primitive? → correct folder
3. Server or client component? → server by default
4. Does it have user-facing text? → Polish
5. Does it involve price/promotion display? → check Omnibus rules (§11)
6. Does it have form inputs? → add aria-label, aria-describedby, error states
7. Does it have interactive elements? → add focus-visible styles
8. Does it use animation? → add useReducedMotion check
9. Does it display cookies/analytics? → check GDPR (§11)
 
---

## 14. SELF-UPDATE PROTOCOL

After EVERY conversation where rules, conventions, or decisions change:

1. Update .cursorrules immediately — add the new rule to the relevant section
2. If the change affects a frontend pattern → update EU_PL_Compliance/FRONTEND_SKILLS.md
3. If the change affects legal compliance → update the relevant EU_PL_Compliance/0X_*.md file
4. Confirm at the end of your response: "✅ Updated: [filename] — [what changed]"

Never wait to be asked. Changes to project conventions must be reflected immediately.